{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"skeleton_archer","model_identifier":"skeleton_archer","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# skeleton_archer\n\nSkeleton archer (C1), walker, 1.75 m = 62 u.\n\nA bare yellowed skeleton of the old kingdom: rotted leather cap, leather bracer on the bow arm, a rag loincloth, quiver of rotten arrows on its back, an old recurve bow, blue-white eye lights. Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names (thin bone limbs) plus a `jaw` bone.\n\n- Cubes: 34 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -9.5..9.2, y 0.0..63.0, z -5.0..4.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 14 x 62 x 10 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `bow_shoot` | 1.4 | once | key 0.9 s: the arrow leaves the string (nock 0.33, full draw 0.77, aim, loose 0.9, back to idle 1.4) |\n| `idle` | 3 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 1 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.62 | loop |  |\n| `aggro` | 1.4 | once | jaw clatters, bow arm thrown out |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch from the front |\n| `death` | 1.6 | hold | bones give way, folds down and backwards, skull lolls; rests on y = 0 |\n| `burn` | 1.2 | loop | writhing in sunlight (loop) |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 35.6 u/s (1.00 m/s), cycle 1.0 s, 35.6 u per cycle (stiff, rattling)\n- `run`: 113.8 u/s (3.20 m/s), cycle 0.62 s, 70.5 u per cycle\n\n## Key times\n\n- `bow_shoot`: key 0.9 s: the arrow leaves the string (nock 0.33, full draw 0.77, aim, loose 0.9, back to idle 1.4)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 62, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 43.5, 4.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2, 47.5, 4.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (3.5, 53, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 41, -4.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (8, 29, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10.5, 35.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-8, 29, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (5, 32, 1.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-5, 32, 1.5)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `recurve_bow` (visible, under slot_hand_l): old recurve bow 43 u, grip at the origin, limbs along Z, string on +Y\n- `quiver` (visible, under slot_quiver) with arrows\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l are the lit eye cubes.\n- Arrows are spawned by the game at slot_hand_r at the key time.\n"},"description":"# skeleton_archer\n\nSkeleton archer (C1), walker, 1.75 m = 62 u.\n\nA bare yellowed skeleton of the old kingdom: rotted leather cap, leather bracer on the bow arm, a rag loincloth, quiver of rotten arrows on its back, an old recurve bow, blue-white eye lights. Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names (thin bone limbs) plus a `jaw` bone.\n\n- Cubes: 34 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -9.5..9.2, y 0.0..63.0, z -5.0..4.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 14 x 62 x 10 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `bow_shoot` | 1.4 | once | key 0.9 s: the arrow leaves the string (nock 0.33, full draw 0.77, aim, loose 0.9, back to idle 1.4) |\n| `idle` | 3 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 1 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.62 | loop |  |\n| `aggro` | 1.4 | once | jaw clatters, bow arm thrown out |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch from the front |\n| `death` | 1.6 | hold | bones give way, folds down and backwards, skull lolls; rests on y = 0 |\n| `burn` | 1.2 | loop | writhing in sunlight (loop) |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 35.6 u/s (1.00 m/s), cycle 1.0 s, 35.6 u per cycle (stiff, rattling)\n- `run`: 113.8 u/s (3.20 m/s), cycle 0.62 s, 70.5 u per cycle\n\n## Key times\n\n- `bow_shoot`: key 0.9 s: the arrow leaves the string (nock 0.33, full draw 0.77, aim, loose 0.9, back to idle 1.4)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 62, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 43.5, 4.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2, 47.5, 4.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (3.5, 53, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 41, -4.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (8, 29, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10.5, 35.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-8, 29, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (5, 32, 1.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-5, 32, 1.5)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `recurve_bow` (visible, under slot_hand_l): old recurve bow 43 u, grip at the origin, limbs along Z, string on +Y\n- `quiver` (visible, under slot_quiver) with arrows\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l are the lit eye cubes.\n- Arrows are spawned by the game at slot_hand_r at the key time.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"neck","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.0,51.5,-1.0],"to":[1.0,54.0,1.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,51.5,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[51,49,53.0,51.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[53,49,55.0,51.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[55,49,57.0,51.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[57,49,59.0,51.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[6,52,8.0,54.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[8,52,10.0,54.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"fc420595-997a-5ab0-8214-4e4f51ec8908"},{"name":"arm_upper_r","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[7.0,40.0,-1.0],"to":[9.0,51.0,1.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[8.0,49.5,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[78,0,80.0,11.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[80,0,82.0,11.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[82,0,84.0,11.0],"texture":0},"w